Riseonly patch on zed 6b2aa1c (Apache-2.0 crate gpui_windows), applied by scripts/vendor-gpui.py after 0002.
Outbound file drag on Windows (P64): WindowsWindow overrides can_start_external_drag and
start_external_drag. The drag is queued and started from a posted message with SHDoDragDrop of a shell
data object carrying CF_HDROP (default drop source), then FileDropEvent::Ended is sent, the same
contract as the macOS dragging session.

